From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Helix <267227783+helix-nine@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 20:08:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 3rdparty/purism-blobs: Fetch from Start9's mirror

source.puri.sm answers 403 to purism-blobs over git and https, so a
fresh checkout cannot populate the submodule and the Librem Mini v2
build stops at its flash descriptor. Start9Labs/purism-blobs carries
the repository's full history, recovered from Software Heritage.

---
 .gitmodules | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.gitmodules b/.gitmodules
index 012529bfa5..adc4fe2a24 100644
--- a/.gitmodules
+++ b/.gitmodules
@@ -80,4 +80,4 @@
 	branch = turin_poc
 [submodule "3rdparty/purism-blobs"]
 	path = 3rdparty/purism-blobs
-	url = https://source.puri.sm/coreboot/purism-blobs.git
+	url = https://github.com/Start9Labs/purism-blobs.git
-- 
2.47.3

